  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\nFor 2020-2025 Hyundai Palisade with 2nd Row Bucket Seats, Rear Trunk Mat with Backrest Mat\nONLY for carpet flooring.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These Trunk Mat with Backrest Mat+Floor Mat are compatible with 2020-2025 Hyundai Palisade with 2nd Row Bucket Seats, not for vehicles with vinyl floors; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back, Please remove old floor mats before installing new ones.\nBUILT FOR DURABILITY: YITAMOTOR floor mats set are compatible with 2020-2024 Hyundai Palisade with 2nd Row Bucket Seats, made from premium TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear-resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extremely cold or hot environments; Product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC.\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The uniquely designed channels and raised edges can effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean. Even in wet conditions, the hooks can effectively prevent the mats from slipping. The mats are available for children and the elderly.\nEasy To Clean: Simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals are needed for maintenance.\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guards to your vehicle.",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
  ],
